/**
 * @file dataflow_wifi.h
 * @brief WiFi TCP Dataflow Transport Interface
 *
 * Features:
 * - Length-prefixed framing (no raw byte stream)
 * - Frame descriptor exchange at connection time
 * - Version handshake with backward compatibility
 * - TCP keepalive for dead peer detection
 * - Reconnection with exponential backoff
 * - Send error handling (EPIPE/ECONNRESET)
 *
 * @note Auto-generated by DataFlow Engine for MCU: environment
 */

